                <syl /><neume facs="#m-a1376a4a-aa95-4bde-8cc1-fdad7f3b163d" type="porrectus" xml:id="m-2f5a764a-2a0a-43f1-bf3c-d6784e2613ee">
                  <nc xml:id="m-1dfb004d-8a61-4223-a8a4-7d924ea80c12" pname="c" oct="4" /><nc xml:id="m-71157e4c-393b-452e-b6f2-df20395011a1" pname="b" oct="3" /><nc xml:id="m-c0791fb5-ffc3-4915-87c0-236d48e72911" pname="c" oct="4" /></neume></syllable><syllable xml:id="m-1efe782d-2473-4dc1-8559-9ff274da98fe">
                <syl /><neume facs="#m-ad431956-5ce5-4a6c-b411-12b4b46e6290" type="torculus" xml:id="m-9373ced5-333f-4588-9cac-aefce6ed22be">
                  <nc xml:id="m-5fed401d-6499-4b90-a116-b210c76e244d" pname="a" oct="3" /><nc xml:id="m-318fef14-68ce-44d2-8b9a-5579155d4191" pname="b" oct="3" /><nc xml:id="m-060429be-49ba-467f-9b7b-6bd72643e533" pname="g" oct="3" /></neume></syllable><custos xml:id="m-8b5ca947-0a87-4a95-aab1-c1ac7b744210" facs="#m-70aebf60-ae3f-48c3-b645-5f035ac6ef65" pname="f" oct="3" /></layer></staff><div xml:id="m-63e4ff63-4f8c-4a56-9cc0-f52ddb41e374"><lg xml:id="m-4d730adb-53f2-4c25-82ec-3a7726136b8b"><l xml:id="m-032a8c55-5249-4f63-97a1-c45cd05b1ea4" facs="#m-7ad6a3e4-9be4-438d-9fe4-efa04ff0d0f0" label="text-like">Feast of the Eucharistic Heart of Jesu¬</l><l xml:id="m-3c4ee57f-295d-465d-807f-0202b555d434" facs="#m-18ff2f9e-aff1-4024-a8ce-13f96cea2c52" label="ambiguous"> Sequentia sancti Evangelii secundum Lucam. Luc. 22.</l><l xml:id="m-590976f3-2152-4b3c-a032-59f3842e4862" facs="#m-e0433e3d-7067-4ddb-8cd1-5a5b92316d86" label="lyrics-like">N illo témpore: Dixit Jesus discí-véniat. Et accépto pane, grátias</l><l xml:id="m-d2f2b34b-8a64-4e8b-add7-9a17df6427a0" facs="#m-98ee703d-0a03-4e80-a66f-36d14466fd15" label="lyrics-like">L pulis suis : Desidério desiderávil egit, et fregit, et dedit eis, dicens:</l><l xml:id="m-0ef4094a-6a38-4f2c-886d-b93605eb6cfa" facs="#m-2c5bb4fe-ef4a-46de-bdbf-46a6518f944e" label="lyrics-like">hoc pascha manducáre vobíscum.</l><l xml:id="m-68f8e0e8-2542-40a9-8f03-b7cb7e916c27" facs="#m-74e7180e-94ec-408d-bf77-5ec92e4fe6f5" label="ambiguous">Hoc est corpus meum, quod pro</l><l xml:id="m-8b6651d7-f7be-4ad3-b031-8669eab1f219" facs="#m-6cacec1c-e55d-4a4e-8d5c-8fdbed0ae832" label="lyrics-like">ántequam pátiar. Dico enim vobis,</l><l xml:id="m-b1331359-8627-42c8-b3e2-991778495b49" facs="#m-f48c5b7f-8e08-4e18-8b58-495a6f543f8b" label="lyrics-like">vobis datur : hoc fácite in meam</l><l xml:id="m-e223929c-216f-49bc-8402-598ac6adfc2b" facs="#m-f0c31a4d-345e-4dc3-ad45-9566f54f8178" label="lyrics-like">quia ex hoc non manducábo illud,</l><l xml:id="m-2969be3e-fca4-4c91-999a-4922e886d8da" facs="#m-d88032e4-bb64-42a8-b2fe-d38c04232a95" label="lyrics-like">commemoratiónem. Similiter et cá¬</l><l xml:id="m-7e88dacf-ee7d-4fb3-ae7c-551eba35b85b" facs="#m-0339a9a2-64aa-4ff1-9928-332f4a83dccc" label="lyrics-like">donec impleátur in regno Dei. Et</l><l xml:id="m-1be9cf0e-5a83-40fc-8a2b-497e158b20e5" facs="#m-98dc73e5-1016-4150-a156-bad7c5504ac2" label="lyrics-like">licem, postquam coenávit, dicens:</l><l xml:id="m-a15e32d9-af16-466c-baa6-518d7bfdc5d3" facs="#m-56d54f81-65f4-4c8f-85f7-fa475cbc9651" label="lyrics-like">accépto cálice, grátias egit, et dixit:</l><l xml:id="m-bcc161fa-391b-48be-b0c8-2e10bb363b33" facs="#m-16e65407-bf9b-43c8-8de3-5223fe16a034" label="lyrics-like">Hic est calix novum testaméntum</l><l xml:id="m-10149e67-697a-4137-b594-7a19450189da" facs="#m-77297097-145e-48ad-82f6-a5e9d095c0f1" label="lyrics-like">Accípite et dividite inter vos. Dico</l><l xml:id="m-7217b005-3758-4c1d-ac94-e0537117c9d9" facs="#m-1b50306b-7031-4d93-9397-23a7f1e1365b" label="lyrics-like">in sánguine meo, qui pro vobis</l><l xml:id="m-d79ca6fa-2221-41ba-8a8a-07e656e98c88" facs="#m-b7f40565-3f8c-46d2-8c53-e0c8b0e3c649" label="lyrics-like">enim vobis quod non bibam de ge- fundétur.</l><l xml:id="m-986ce1d6-22b0-4335-84c0-a908b3894d7b" facs="#m-3105c94d-886b-4170-ba31-cc3cccaa8dec" label="ambiguous">Credo.</l><l xml:id="m-4d545a7c-79a9-490c-a45c-eae96db450de" facs="#m-6cce833f-4236-41b7-a704-a3ff23dde5f1" label="lyrics-like">neratióne vitis, donec regnum Deil</l><l xml:id="m-e3e885ab-a8f6-42d8-97b2-432e2e232633" facs="#m-935ab3b9-c9a7-4d11-9baa-f41d7d3430c1" label="ambiguous">ofrert.E</l><l xml:id="m-2d2fde89-a370-40f6-8731-58fa419bce50" facs="#m-8169eeaa-8624-413e-9b8f-c30d73c0cad4" label="ambiguous">1.</l><l xml:id="m-74b0dd34-628e-4aca-831d-7b6e101e6557" facs="#m-0a1b3d2c-79f6-42a1-b447-d221999e439d" label="lyrics-like">Uam má-gna“ multi-tú-do</l><l xml:id="m-66739e6a-f5e9-4ba3-bbfe-dd3aac6f5aa3" facs="#m-9eaa5e94-aac9-4f63-adfc-0a3c4cac7b3b" label="lyrics-like">dulcédi¬</l><l xml:id="m-c19c7fb2-0100-4b63-a232-d1c0faebc85b" facs="#m-d125ec8f-9066-4238-8bf0-27ab0b556f7a" label="lyrics-like">timén¬</l><l xml:id="m-c61b7735-59a6-431a-988d-3429a6f51fbf" facs="#m-cf93f3fa-a25e-4baa-95d1-d7c9978ce4a9" label="lyrics-like">nis tú- ae, Dó-mi- ne, quam abscondísti</l><l xml:id="m-e9387348-ac0c-40c3-8583-86bd1b5b0bb8" facs="#m-7e74aeef-1621-47ae-adcf-b402b762f23b" label="ambiguous">—Alle¬</l><l xml:id="m-0cacf178-bd4e-4d2b-9f31-1d5aedae91a2" facs="#m-97b2f4d6-63da-4443-9621-7e4fb0c1f3e5" label="ambiguous">ti-bus te.</l><l xml:id="m-c4ef42ca-3e00-42ca-953f-2e52079b4206" facs="#m-666cd87b-1c04-42a9-bdfa-0c048c2c7800" label="lyrics-like">lú¬</l><l xml:id="m-6786494a-e411-452e-a001-d17c0ab0ea6b" facs="#m-c4dce0c6-a5a8-40fa-8063-8f5335973642" label="text-like">ia. After Septuag.:t</l><l xml:id="m-184685bc-da17-490d-9b54-699284fd89cb" facs="#m-c9b07ef1-ce62-41e1-a99f-5eb0dc514e5d" label="ambiguous">Secret.</l><l xml:id="m-52b4928f-e60f-4420-8478-9bd9c238d4b7" facs="#m-11e580fe-eab5-47f2-bc16-09d55a5b085e" label="lyrics-like">TUére nos, Dómine, tua tibi ho-! tur, flammis adúre tuae divinae ca¬</l><l xml:id="m-7c019317-348a-4d00-8503-c4ece096bafd" facs="#m-bb07e488-4cc4-4e80-a6fb-eafddbd8c039" label="lyrics-like">I locáusta offeréntes: ad quae ut ritátis : Qui vivis.</l><l xml:id="m-726d891e-4c20-40f8-b7a2-827596550b2c" facs="#m-eb00563e-a589-4e27-92db-641a26263e3c" label="lyrics-like">fervéntius corda nostra praeparén¬</l><l xml:id="m-e299df5c-f278-4e2c-b565-74ec710fc4e0" facs="#m-d1744e20-0748-40ae-a339-046d47b37325" label="ambiguous">comm.E</l><l xml:id="m-85852a21-281d-45d4-8fc7-6bdadba7f0db" facs="#m-902b1e90-419c-440a-9da4-18337ff14c96" label="ambiguous">3.</l><l xml:id="m-b93a4dac-c712-4d87-9086-cd592a1f05f0" facs="#m-604b1752-74f0-4e24-b3a7-5d21abd6aaec" label="lyrics-like">ómnibus</l><l xml:id="m-439c11a0-a519-4b2d-916a-20e262cc48ae" facs="#m-3042fbbd-7114-47d6-804e-ac23ec45b2ca" label="lyrics-like">"vobís-cum sum</l><l xml:id="m-491de379-2ec5-40f9-9d77-6291c1f2ac8e" facs="#m-42f47f65-ff99-48f2-8ed0-e39ecd6394a8" label="lyrics-like">UC-ce égo</l><l xml:id="m-a8ff748c-a917-4b57-a434-e6cb6f72a4c8" facs="#m-d986e757-7702-4b48-a8e0-40609cc4dc6a" label="lyrics-like">di-é-bus,</l><l xml:id="m-c47bb94c-3891-411e-92d2-bcd2996676ec" facs="#m-922696b7-3804-4c60-ab39-fe190335248e" label="lyrics-like">usque ad consumma-ti-o- nem saé-cu¬</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
